# Archive/Legacy/ — severed legacy

This directory holds the **legacy "Before" iOS app** + supporting
modules + the Before-coupled root build configuration that pre-dated
the BehavioralAISubstrate library's independence。

User directive 2026-05-20 「我想要 把 before 完全 断绝。我想 先 完成
14层电子脑 再 决定」 — sever Before completely so the substrate
(14-layer 电子脑) can evolve independently。

